h the gritty, distorted intimacy that eventually defined an entire genre of movies. Id X and Y.", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:16:17Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Maine apne saare praising wale msgs ko collate kar liye, ab usse hi llama app banwa raha hun to generate compliments", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:16:18Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Srs", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:16:29Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Ben hur", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:16:42Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Ben Hur", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:16:47Z", "username": "Gautam Ramachandran", "text": "North by Northwest?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:17:02Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Biccyle thieves?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:17:06Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Neo realist, hmm", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:17:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Oh wow", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:17:11Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Nice", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:17:19Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Italian film, of course", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-30T17:17:26Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "I only we